der":"tvdb_show","id":"305101","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"33251","synopsis":"Because their mother Haruko is staying with them, Haru continues to watch his public displays of affection with Ren. Without much consideration for his situation, Ikuyoshi asks Haru a question. Meanwhile, unable to express his feelings for Haru, Ren and his classmate Juuzen question their school's doctor Takamura. One day, after hearing about Haru's medical checkup after the accident, Aki aggressively attacks Haruko...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yEZD6HBHHKupgeb4Ir8Qd6S0Aei.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 2","synopsis":"Because their mother Haruko is staying with them, Haru continues to watch his public displays of affection with Ren. Without much consideration for his situation, Ikuyoshi asks Haru a question. Meanwhile, unable to express his feelings for Haru, Ren and his classmate Juuzen question their school's doctor Takamura. One day, after hearing about Haru's medical checkup after the accident, Aki aggressively attacks Haruko...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yEZD6HBHHKupgeb4Ir8Qd6S0Aei.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12197","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21836","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"33417","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"66104","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"305101","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"33252","synopsis":"It's Ren's first summer vacation in Japan. The landlord of the apartment he and Haru once lived in hires him to clean one of his apartment units. Haru becomes unbearably curious when Ren refuses to tell him why he got a part time job. Kiyoka suspects Kiri, Ren's female classmate who has been coming over with her dog to hang out. Meanwhile, an unknown man approaches Ren.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aR3xlMA8dWsWPhfudAaIkLA0Hye.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"It's Ren's first summer vacation in Japan. The landlord of the apartment he and Haru once lived in hires him to clean one of his apartment units. Haru becomes unbearably curious when Ren refuses to tell him why he got a part time job. Kiyoka suspects Kiri, Ren's female classmate who has been coming over with her dog to hang out. Meanwhile, an unknown man approaches Ren.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aR3xlMA8dWsWPhfudAaIkLA0Hye.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12197","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21836","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"33417","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"66104","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"305101","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"33257","synopsis":"Ren is forced into the car of a strange man. Natsuki, who bears a striking resemblance to Haru, claims to be the cousin of the Kaidou brothers. Shiba Natsuo tells Ren to keep it a secret from his brothers that they met, but Ren is met by Haru and the twins who were concerned that he was so late coming home. Haru tells Ren to quit his job out of concern, but Ren is sick of being treated like a child.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/29HZfMBJTtQYqsO2B2ni9yadxmG.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"Ren is forced into the car of a strange man. Natsuki, who bears a striking resemblance to Haru, claims to be the cousin of the Kaidou brothers. Shiba Natsuo tells Ren to keep it a secret from his brothers that they met, but Ren is met by Haru and the twins who were concerned that he was so late coming home. Haru tells Ren to quit his job out of concern, but Ren is sick of being treated like a child.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/29HZfMBJTtQYqsO2B2ni9yadxmG.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12197","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21836","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"33417","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"66104","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"305101","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"33253","synopsis":"Ren spends the night away from home and brings home a large amount of money. Haru, who was up all night with worry, begins acting cold towards Ren when he won't tell him why. The next morning, Ren heads out to his friend Kiri's house to train her family's dog without clearing the air between them. In order to avoid being at cross-purposes with each other, Haru goes to buy a new phone for Ren. A strange man calls Ren's cell phone.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iGvA8jIdzrenAA9AluZIemi99qY.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"Ren spends the night away from home and brings home a large amount of money. Haru, who was up all night with worry, begins acting cold towards Ren when he won't tell him why. The next morning, Ren heads out to his friend Kiri's house to train her family's dog without clearing the air between them. In order to avoid being at cross-purposes with each other, Haru goes to buy a new phone for Ren. A strange man calls Ren's cell phone.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iGvA8jIdzrenAA9AluZIemi99qY.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12197","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21836","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"33417","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"66104","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"305101","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"33256","synopsis":"The accident that made Haru lose his parents seven years ago left him on the brink of death. Though he made a miraculous recovery, he hasn't gone to the hospital for a checkup since he was released, so a concerned Aki and Shima ask Ren to take him there. Unaware of the situation, Haru believes Ren is taking him on a date, but they end up at the hospital. While waiting for Haru in the waiting area Haru's psychotherapist Mori strikes up a conversation with Ren.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5xlfvtqcnuLqVZdcrGIXRDUSKgN.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"The accident that made Haru lose his parents seven years ago left him on the brink of death. Though he made a miraculous recovery, he hasn't gone to the hospital for a checkup since he was released, so a concerned Aki and Shima ask Ren to take him there. Unaware of the situation, Haru believes Ren is taking him on a date, but they end up at the hospital. While waiting for Haru in the waiting area Haru's psychotherapist Mori strikes up a conversation with Ren.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5xlfvtqcnuLqVZdcrGIXRDUSKgN.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12197","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21836","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"33417","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"66104","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id"